            "review_title": "Review at Steakhouse De Paris",
            "review_text": "Nguyen D\nDa Nang, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nBest choice for steak in Ha Noi\nAug 2024 • Family\nI was here for lunch with my family and the experience was amazing\n\nThe place is large, we had a separated room for 20 people. The decor is beautiful, and premium, the “fire wall” is so unique, you should definitely check-in with it\n\nThe staffs were very nice too, tentative and helpful.\n\nAbove all the steak was great, we had the rib-eye and wagyu, both were amazing. The crust was crispy and flavorful, and the inside was so tender it practically melted. Definitely the best steak I’ve ever had\n\nI’ll comeback for sure and highlight recommended for everyone looking for great steak in Hanoi\nRead more\nWritten August 7, 2024",
