            "review_title": "Review at Steakhouse De Paris",
            "review_text": "Giang\nHanoi, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\n𝐠𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐦𝐨𝐨𝐝, 𝐠𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐥𝐢𝐟𝐞, 𝐛𝐞𝐜𝐚𝐮𝐬𝐞 𝐲𝐨𝐮 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐞 𝐢𝐭\nJul 2024 • Family\nDelicious food, reasonable price. Unlimited salads, very suitable for healthy eaters like me ^^.\nLuxurious space, suitable for couples. There are even private rooms for families.\nEspecially for customers who travel by car, it is very convenient because parking in front of the store is free and parking is free at The One building.\n10 points without criticism. Will come back many times ♥️\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nWear nice clothes so you can take check-in photos\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 31, 2024",
